# ===========================
# Windows reserved device name
# A file literally named `nul` appears when a Windows-style redirect
# (`> nul` / `2>nul`) runs under a Unix shell (Git Bash / MSYS), which
# treats `nul` as a regular file instead of the discard device.
# Pattern without a slash ignores it in any directory.
# ===========================
nul

docs/
prompts/

